1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,455
From Tripura to Bollywood.

2
00:00:02,495 --> 00:00:09,060
Tripura's Soumee Sailesh has sung playback in Salman Khan's film Maatrubhumi.

3
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:15,330
Soumee, from Chebri in Khowai district, is also known as Sanhita Debnath.

4
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:18,343
She learnt music first from her mother

5
00:00:18,383 --> 00:00:22,190
and moved to Mumbai in 2017 to follow her dream.

6
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:27,565
She has now sung on the film's song, Madirapan.

7
00:00:27,605 --> 00:00:32,205
The music is by Himesh Reshammiya and the lyrics by Sameer Anjaan.

8
00:00:32,245 --> 00:00:35,940
Javed Ali and Mohd Danish are also among the song's singers.

9
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:45,170
My song Madirapan, sung in my voice, has been released.

10
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:48,050
This is a very special moment for me.

11
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:52,330
Coming from Tripura to Mumbai, and from there the journey to Bollywood,

12
00:00:52,370 --> 00:00:54,410
is not just an achievement for me.

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:58,650
It is the result of many years of dreams, hard work and patience.

14
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:02,126
Soumee dreams of becoming an established

15
00:01:02,166 --> 00:01:05,350
playback singer and working with A.R. Rahman.

16
00:01:05,390 --> 00:01:09,420
From Chebri to Bollywood, her journey continues.

